["[[Cynthia Gibson]]"],"published":"2026-07-28","created":"2026-07-28","description":"An alarming trend has emerged in Idaho: toxic algae is appearing earlier in the year and, in many places, lasting longer. That trend matters for anyone who enjoys Idaho’s lakes, rivers, and reservoirs. Toxic algae can turn your favorite recreation spot into a health hazard."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},